Vendor BSPs and SDK binaries

Silicon-vendor BSPs and SDK binaries (Alif Ensemble, Renesas RZ/V2N,
DEEPX DX-M1) are NOT redistributed in this repository. They are
obtained directly from the vendor under the vendor's own license. The
vendors/<name>/ directories here contain only Alp Lab's own integration
shims (Apache-2.0) plus instructions; see each vendors/<name>/README.md.

One exception, carried under the vendor's own terms rather than Apache-2.0
(ADR 0032): metadata/svd/alif/ contains Alif Semiconductor's CMSIS-SVD
register descriptions for the Ensemble E8 (AE822) M55-HE and M55-HP cores,
copied unmodified from alifsemi/alif_ensemble-cmsis-dfp, with Alif's
unmodified License.txt beside them. Those files are not covered by this
repository's Apache-2.0 LICENSE; use is restricted to Alif silicon. See
metadata/svd/alif/README.md.
